  pages:
  - pageTitle: Deploying Your Army
    pageDescription: Check your available Reinforcement Points and select your trained
      troops from the recruitment bar to prepare them for battle.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8214adf1f9584d458050d494a1c7d53, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Troop Placement
    pageDescription: Position your units onto valid grid tiles. Strategically place
      your troops to form effective line defenses and attack paths.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a23e78448908dbf43a530ab01e319563, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Managing Turns
    pageDescription: Click **End Setup** after placing your troops to start combat.
      Once you have executed your tactical moves, click **End Turn** to pass control.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e43f1aac271adba409ff4a71b1478e64, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Battle Outcomes
    pageDescription: Defeat enemy forces to earn victory! If your army falls, click
      Restart to adjust your tactics or Return to manage your kingdom.
    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 083b11bfc30014441879a5c0ea9d21ad, type: 3}
